  storyText: "Broseph Ale\n\nThe bartender, Maggie, slides you a cold Broseph. You have 15 eb.\n\n\"See the guy in the back booth with the Kiroshi optics? Fixer. Been asking all night for someone with a clean record and empty pockets. You qualify, choom.\"\n\n1. Go talk to the fixer.\n2. \"What's the catch?\"\n3. Just drink."
